assert arithmetic_triplet([1, 2, 3, 4, 5]) == True
assert arithmetic_triplet([1]) == False
assert arithmetic_triplet([1, 2, 4]) == False
assert arithmetic_triplet([1, 3, 5, 7, 9]) == True
assert arithmetic_triplet([10, 20, 30]) == True

## Canonical Elixir names (use verbatim)
- Module: `Solution`
- Function: `arithmetic_triplet`

